    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30bf\u30fc\u30dc\u30d0\u30d0\u30a2 | Turbo Granny is a survival horror game inspired by an urban legend of an old woman who moves at incredible speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You ventured into a tunnel rumored to be haunted by an old woman who runs at an abnormal speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being attacked by the Turbo Granny inside the tunnel, you wake up in a mysterious old Japanese house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with the Turbo Granny roaming the corridors, you must hide and find a way to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic and unsettling VHS-style visual effects (can be toggled on/off in settings)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror experience with selectable difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling gameplay as you explore the mansion and try to escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated maps and items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming &amp; Let\u2019s Plays</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and video content are welcome\u2014no need to contact us in advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, we\u2019d appreciate it if you include this store page URL in your video description or stream info.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30bf\u30fc\u30dc\u30d0\u30d0\u30a2 | Turbo Granny is a survival horror game inspired by an urban legend of an old woman who moves at incredible speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You ventured into a tunnel rumored to be haunted by an old woman who runs at an abnormal speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being attacked by the Turbo Granny inside the tunnel, you wake up in a mysterious old Japanese house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with the Turbo Granny roaming the corridors, you must hide and find a way to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic and unsettling VHS-style visual effects (can be toggled on/off in settings)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror experience with selectable difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling gameplay as you explore the mansion and try to escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated maps and items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming &amp; Let\u2019s Plays</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and video content are welcome\u2014no need to contact us in advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, we\u2019d appreciate it if you include this store page URL in your video description or stream info.</p>",
